---
import Profile from "../layouts/Profile.astro";
import FieldPlate from "../components/FieldPlate.astro";
---

<Profile slug="spiritual-mentor" related={["speaker", "author", "business"]}>
  <Fragment slot="intro">
    I’m a Ritwik (<span lang="bn">ঋত্বিক</span>). My Living Ideal is{" "}
    <a href="https://masterwithin.net/thakur/who-is-thakur/">
      Sree Sree Thakur Anukulchandra
    </a>
    . Through <a href="https://masterwithin.net/">Master Within</a>, I read his
    words with people and talk about what they ask of us at home, at work and in
    our relationships.
  </Fragment>
  <div slot="lead" class="profile-actions">
    <a class="profile-button" href="https://masterwithin.net/class/">
      Come to a Living Wisdom class
    </a>
  </div>
  <FieldPlate
    slot="plate"
    photo="in-conversation"
    label="Master Within / Conversation"
    caption="Reading and conversation are part of my work as a Ritwik."
  />

  <section class="folio-row">
    <div>
      <span class="stamp">A first visit</span>
      <h2>What happens in a class?</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        I read a passage of Thakur’s aloud. We look at what a word means in
        context, then talk about where that idea turns up in our own lives. The
        weekly conversation is in Bengali and Hindi. On your first visit you’re
        welcome to listen, with your camera off if you prefer.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you’re coming across his name for the first time,{" "}
        <a href="https://masterwithin.net/start/thakur/">
          this short introduction to Thakur
        </a>{" "}
        gives you a place to begin.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="folio-row">
    <div>
      <span class="stamp">From the foundation</span>
      <h2>A question to read with</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        What guides a decision when the same act helps one person and hurts
        another? I took up that question in{" "}
        <a href="https://masterwithin.substack.com/p/what-does-not-move">
          What Does Not Move
        </a>
        . It’s one way into what I mean when I speak about Dharma.
      </p>
      <p>
        I co-founded{" "}
        <a href="https://masterwithin.net/">Master Within Foundation</a> in
        2016. Our work brings spiritual practice, education and social service
        together.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="folio-row">
    <h2>Bijnan-Vibhuti</h2>
    <div>
      <p>
        As a physicist and a reader of Thakur, I’m interested in the questions
        his philosophy brings to science. I call this work <i>Bijnan-Vibhuti</i>
        . His vision of the Satsang Vishwa Vigyan Kendra inspired{" "}
        <a href="https://vishwavigyan.com/">Vishwa Vigyan</a>.
      </p>
      <a href="https://masterwithin.substack.com/p/rebuilding-vishwa-vigyan">
        Read my essay on rebuilding Vishwa Vigyan →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Profile>
